sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Strategy Author
    participant UI as Web Authoring UI
    participant GO as Go Edge API
    participant SAS as Python Authoring Service
    participant FETCH as Safe Document Fetcher
    participant LLM as Structured LLM Adapter
    participant VAL as StrategySpec Validator
    participant PRE as Preview/Sandbox Evaluator
    participant REG as StrategyRegistry
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    A->>UI: nhập JSON DSL hoặc mô tả tự nhiên hoặc URL
    UI->>GO: POST /strategy-drafts (idempotency key)
    GO->>GO: auth + quota + body/rate limit
    GO->>SAS: principal + source_type + source

    alt source_type = URL
        SAS->>FETCH: fetch allowlisted URL
        FETCH->>FETCH: HTTPS + DNS/IP/redirect/size guard
        FETCH-->>SAS: extracted text + source_url + content_hash
    else source_type = text/DSL
        SAS->>SAS: normalize text or parse JSON
    end

    opt mô tả tự nhiên hoặc extracted text
        SAS->>LLM: schema-constrained prompt<br/>model_version + prompt_version
        LLM-->>SAS: StrategySpec JSON only
    end

    SAS->>VAL: validate schema + supported indicators/operators<br/>bounded lookback + no network/DB/tool/code
    alt invalid/unsupported/ambiguous
        VAL-->>SAS: field errors/questions
        SAS-->>GO: draft rejected + structured errors
        GO-->>UI: draft rejected + field errors/questions
    else valid
        VAL->>PRE: compile deterministic execution plan<br/>run bounded preview fixture
        PRE-->>SAS: normalized rules + sample signals + warnings<br/>source/model/prompt versions
        SAS-->>GO: safe preview DTO
        GO-->>UI: preview DTO
        A->>UI: explicit approve
        UI->>GO: POST /strategy-drafts/{id}/approve
        GO->>SAS: approve(draft_id, principal)
        SAS->>DB: BEGIN · immutable strategy_definition<br/>+ strategy_version + source/provenance + fingerprint · COMMIT
        SAS->>REG: refresh approved version
        REG-->>SAS: strategy_id@version registered
        SAS-->>GO: approved strategy DTO
        GO-->>UI: strategy_id@version available
    end

    Note over LLM,REG: LLM không sinh rồi chạy Python/Go tùy ý.<br/>Nó chỉ tạo declarative StrategySpec hợp lệ.<br/>Validator và compiler quyết định spec nào được thực thi.
